      {
        "id": 251322,
        "name": "",
        "username": "skywhale",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skywhale/{size}/5248_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-03-13T17:08:55.492Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Variables are checked whenever they are relevant, not on play (or power use). So for Shielding Winds, that variable is checked when a target is being targeted for damage, not when you play Shielding Winds.</p>\n<p>Definitive Edition doesn’t generally require you to remember anything beyond the current turn, as that would introduce fiddly tracking.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-03-13T17:08:55.492Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
