        "raw": "The general principle here is that, in DE, the game state is supposed to be fully captured by the cards on the table at any given moment, and not \"remembered\" from some earlier state.\n\nSo for the example with Nightmist, whenever you do something that involves her symbol, you check what the top card of her trash is *right then.* That might be different from the symbol on top of her trash when she played the card, due for instance to another hero granting her a power use.",
